WEBVTT

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:26.614
A ship laden with sorrows

00:00:28.594 --> 00:00:38.794
Loudly singing its song of ruin

00:00:43.604 --> 00:00:48.134
From the blackest depths

00:00:49.574 --> 00:00:54.674
It rises to the surface

00:00:58.654 --> 00:01:09.794
Oh! You and I! We stretch our white wings now!

00:01:10.604 --> 00:01:21.544
Flying off into the vast sky

00:01:21.544 --> 00:01:35.724
We dream of that day, dream of that day

00:01:51.944 --> 00:01:52.964
Hey.

00:01:57.014 --> 00:02:01.674
I'm really sorry about what happened.

00:02:02.354 --> 00:02:04.184
But please believe me.

00:02:04.654 --> 00:02:07.644
It was an accident no one
could have prevented.

00:02:08.594 --> 00:02:12.394
Please don't blame the commander.

00:02:29.844 --> 00:02:35.414
Ship output 16%.
Firearm control access denied.

00:02:35.414 --> 00:02:41.944
Vessel attitude maintenance malfunctioning.
Executing self-recovery functions.

00:02:49.934 --> 00:02:52.494
Remembrance.

00:02:56.504 --> 00:03:01.604
Novaal to A1: Permission to dock granted.
Enter at number 12 beacon.

00:03:01.974 --> 00:03:04.034
This is A1. Roger.

00:03:07.114 --> 00:03:10.714
A1 docking completed!
Transferring to Hangar 3.

00:03:11.654 --> 00:03:15.214
Yes. How are the megabomber preparations?

00:03:17.024 --> 00:03:19.324
Fueling is in progress.

00:03:19.964 --> 00:03:22.434
The vessel is being prepared for launch.

00:03:23.034 --> 00:03:24.054
Good.

00:03:24.504 --> 00:03:27.934
But... are you absolutely sure, Commander?

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:32.874
Using that powerful a weapon
without Arume's consent...

00:03:35.314 --> 00:03:38.674
The main invasion fleet is already
moving into configuration.

00:03:39.044 --> 00:03:44.854
With the full invasion jut around the corner, we
can't afford a moment's hesitation.

00:03:46.184 --> 00:03:48.494
Fear not! Proceed with the preparations!

00:03:48.494 --> 00:03:49.544
Yes, Ma'am!

00:03:49.724 --> 00:03:53.054
Set a course for Trench Five!

00:03:53.194 --> 00:03:54.164
Roger!

00:03:56.594 --> 00:03:59.034
All right. That wraps up class for today.

00:03:59.034 --> 00:03:59.864
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms

00:03:59.864 --> 00:04:02.804
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
The afternoon will be devoted to
preparing for the school festival.

00:04:02.804 --> 00:04:03.544
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
Yes, Teacher!

00:04:03.544 --> 00:04:04.574
Yes, Teacher!

00:04:04.574 --> 00:04:10.744
Class Chairman Senkoji is absent
due to family circumstances.

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:15.044
Miss Kozuki, I'm afraid you'll
have to manage on your own.

00:04:15.484 --> 00:04:16.414
Yes, Teacher!

00:04:17.284 --> 00:04:22.084
Actresses, we'll be running through
the performance on stage.

00:04:22.794 --> 00:04:25.784
Please gather in the auditorium after lunch.

00:04:25.964 --> 00:04:27.524
Okay!

00:04:28.864 --> 00:04:31.164
Oh, no! This system's down, too.

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:33.494
No firearm control, even.

00:04:33.974 --> 00:04:35.434
Oh, dear...

00:04:40.514 --> 00:04:42.134
I tried to tell her...

00:05:00.764 --> 00:05:02.164
Onomil?

00:05:03.764 --> 00:05:06.794
Long time no see, Commander Ekaril!

00:05:11.904 --> 00:05:15.434
Okay, let's take it from the top.

00:05:16.644 --> 00:05:18.914
For now, you can use your scripts.

00:05:19.284 --> 00:05:20.744
Okay.

00:05:20.984 --> 00:05:22.714
All right. Action!

00:05:23.154 --> 00:05:24.414
Here we go!

00:05:26.024 --> 00:05:27.614
Er... uh...

00:05:30.564 --> 00:05:32.164
Mari! Your line!

00:05:32.164 --> 00:05:34.524
Um... uh...

00:05:34.964 --> 00:05:39.024
Er, what was it?

00:05:43.874 --> 00:05:45.204
But why?

00:05:45.844 --> 00:05:49.834
But you're... aren't you...

00:05:51.014 --> 00:05:54.244
I don't really know myself.

00:05:54.984 --> 00:05:57.474
I just suddenly found myself here.

00:05:58.724 --> 00:06:01.454
I... I... Onomil...

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:04.414
I owe you an apology, too!

00:06:04.894 --> 00:06:06.924
You do? But why?

00:06:06.924 --> 00:06:14.164
You and the entire landing crew and
all those people died... and I...

00:06:20.314 --> 00:06:22.474
All I could do was watch!

00:06:23.944 --> 00:06:26.604
I couldn't do anything!

00:06:29.014 --> 00:06:31.074
I'm so sorry, Onomil!

00:06:33.554 --> 00:06:38.084
I'm really sorry. I... I...

00:06:38.494 --> 00:06:44.124
I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry, Onomil!

00:06:44.534 --> 00:06:50.834
You haven't changed a bit, Commander.
Of course, that's why I like you.

00:06:53.914 --> 00:06:55.134
Wait, Onomil!

00:06:57.214 --> 00:07:00.584
Don't try to shoulder everything alone!

00:07:01.754 --> 00:07:03.154
Onomil!

00:07:07.454 --> 00:07:10.324
You always used to say that...

00:07:14.134 --> 00:07:16.864
This is too much, Joan of Arc!

00:07:16.994 --> 00:07:21.864
You're to die on the morrow, yet you
continue to deny that you are Joan!

00:07:22.374 --> 00:07:26.174
Has the fear of execution driven
you from your senses?

00:07:26.874 --> 00:07:28.174
That's not it!

00:07:28.174 --> 00:07:31.544
The real Joan is right there!

00:07:31.544 --> 00:07:31.914
Senkoji
The real Joan is right there!

00:07:31.914 --> 00:07:32.084
Senkoji

00:07:32.084 --> 00:07:33.384
Senkoji
Can't you see her?

00:07:33.384 --> 00:07:37.144
Can't you see her?

00:07:39.454 --> 00:07:42.544
Uh... Wakatake? Er...

00:07:44.764 --> 00:07:47.824
Tell me, Joan!

00:07:47.934 --> 00:07:55.864
Together, we endured torments untold. And yet
the road we traveled was one of exalted honor!

00:07:56.374 --> 00:08:00.434
But now you're locked away in this prison!

00:08:00.844 --> 00:08:02.204
How can it be, Joan?

00:08:02.814 --> 00:08:10.274
Answer me, Joan! What was it for?
What did it all mean?

00:08:12.554 --> 00:08:14.684
Wakatake! It's your line!

00:08:18.194 --> 00:08:19.354
Senkoji

00:08:26.664 --> 00:08:28.004
Master Akane!

00:08:28.004 --> 00:08:30.504
Art thou hurt, Master Akane?

00:08:30.504 --> 00:08:34.274
The nefarious Mari Wakatake...

00:08:35.044 --> 00:08:38.844
Oh! Oh! Master Akane!

00:08:40.654 --> 00:08:41.854
Bravo!

00:08:41.854 --> 00:08:43.344
Well done!

00:08:45.784 --> 00:08:47.484
That's enough!

00:08:54.494 --> 00:08:57.294
What's wrong with you?

00:08:57.904 --> 00:09:01.334
The performance is right around the corner!

00:09:02.134 --> 00:09:08.304
All sorts of people are coming to watch. It's a
page of Kaio's history. This is an important play!

00:09:08.744 --> 00:09:12.814
I didn't write this story...

00:09:12.814 --> 00:09:14.974
so that everyone could just fool around!

00:09:17.354 --> 00:09:19.044
Michi!

00:09:21.754 --> 00:09:22.524
Chemistry Lab

00:09:22.524 --> 00:09:25.024
Chemistry Lab
Oh? Miss Kozuki said that?

00:09:25.024 --> 00:09:25.494
Oh? Miss Kozuki said that?

00:09:25.924 --> 00:09:29.454
What about you, Mari? You seem blue.

00:09:29.694 --> 00:09:30.924
Did something happen?

00:09:31.904 --> 00:09:33.104
Teacher...

00:09:33.104 --> 00:09:34.064
Yes?

00:09:34.374 --> 00:09:37.704
About my mom and dad...

00:09:39.344 --> 00:09:41.864
How did they die?

00:09:43.744 --> 00:09:44.904
Did you remember?

00:09:45.444 --> 00:09:51.214
Did they really kill each other? Please tell me!

00:09:51.754 --> 00:09:53.014
Mari...

00:09:58.294 --> 00:10:03.024
We still don't know exactly
what happened. But...

00:10:05.434 --> 00:10:07.494
Okay!

00:10:14.814 --> 00:10:16.444
Oh, dear.

00:10:16.444 --> 00:10:19.314
Telling a subject classified information...

00:10:20.144 --> 00:10:23.084
Maybe I need a career change!

00:10:25.354 --> 00:10:28.324
Did they really kill each other?

00:10:30.024 --> 00:10:32.224
Someone must have told her!

00:10:32.524 --> 00:10:34.294
But... Who on earth?

00:10:34.294 --> 00:10:35.664
Aliens
But... Who on earth?

00:10:35.664 --> 00:10:37.154
Aliens

00:10:38.504 --> 00:10:40.494
Megabomber fueling complete!

00:10:40.804 --> 00:10:42.494
Proceed to flight deck!

00:10:51.314 --> 00:10:53.834
Hey, stop! I said, stop!

00:10:53.914 --> 00:10:55.944
But chief...

00:10:57.184 --> 00:10:58.684
What's this all about?

00:10:58.684 --> 00:11:02.684
Deploying a megabomber without permission?
Who authorized this?!

00:11:02.794 --> 00:11:07.934
I have direct orders from the Master
Commander. We haven't done anything...

00:11:07.934 --> 00:11:09.764
Commander Shivariel?

00:11:12.064 --> 00:11:14.404
What's going on here?!

00:11:15.604 --> 00:11:17.904
The commander is entering the bridge.

00:11:20.844 --> 00:11:22.104
Commander!

00:11:22.974 --> 00:11:25.344
Sorry to worry you.

00:11:25.814 --> 00:11:28.544
Please, don't be...

00:11:28.984 --> 00:11:30.174
How's the ship?

00:11:30.584 --> 00:11:33.584
Oh! It's currently executing auto-repairs...

00:11:33.584 --> 00:11:35.184
But the damage is so great...

00:11:37.394 --> 00:11:38.794
And the engine?

00:11:39.524 --> 00:11:41.514
Functionality is at 20%.

00:11:44.304 --> 00:11:46.464
Enough to shift one person.

00:11:47.604 --> 00:11:50.234
You mean... a Leminof shift?

00:11:53.304 --> 00:11:59.144
It's a stupid play after all.
That's why they can't get into it!

00:11:59.814 --> 00:12:02.974
But I had to go and blow my top at everyone...

00:12:15.564 --> 00:12:16.654
Mari?

00:12:20.264 --> 00:12:24.394
No! I said no!

00:12:24.674 --> 00:12:29.614
I can't! Not after what happened! I just...

00:12:30.844 --> 00:12:33.334
It's okay. Come on! Okay?

00:12:40.454 --> 00:12:44.324
No, no! You've got to ridicule Joan more!

00:12:44.564 --> 00:12:45.994
Oh, right!

00:12:46.864 --> 00:12:49.454
"Truly, there was a time when..."

00:12:49.694 --> 00:12:53.934
"...we held you in the
highest esteem and regard!"

00:12:54.374 --> 00:12:58.234
"But Joan, in your current state,"

00:12:58.344 --> 00:13:01.174
"what shred of dignity do you retain?"

00:13:03.044 --> 00:13:06.014
All right! Much better!

00:13:06.144 --> 00:13:07.614
You've got it!

00:13:08.054 --> 00:13:09.784
It's going to be fine!

00:13:09.784 --> 00:13:11.514
Your movements are better, too!

00:13:13.184 --> 00:13:14.624
Thank you!

00:13:15.824 --> 00:13:17.294
Yeah, but...

00:13:17.524 --> 00:13:21.464
Is there any point to us practicing alone?

00:13:22.234 --> 00:13:23.694
Good point.

00:13:24.304 --> 00:13:28.064
Miss Kozuki and Lady Hagino aren't here.

00:13:28.634 --> 00:13:30.174
I hope they come back!

00:13:30.174 --> 00:13:30.904
Wakatake
I hope they come back!

00:13:33.744 --> 00:13:35.244
Don't be silly!

00:13:35.244 --> 00:13:37.474
This play belongs to all of us!

00:13:37.984 --> 00:13:42.144
We've got to do everything we
can until they come back!

00:13:43.114 --> 00:13:44.414
Now, once more.

00:13:45.384 --> 00:13:46.784
Hey, Kozuki!

00:13:50.594 --> 00:13:51.794
Everyone!

00:13:51.794 --> 00:13:53.284
Miss Kozuki!

00:13:53.394 --> 00:13:55.124
Welcome back, boss!

00:13:55.534 --> 00:13:56.734
We've been waiting!

00:13:56.734 --> 00:13:58.634
We're all working hard!

00:13:59.004 --> 00:14:00.334
Just wait and see!

00:14:00.464 --> 00:14:01.574
Welcome back!

00:14:01.574 --> 00:14:03.124
Sorry about before!

00:14:04.034 --> 00:14:07.804
Everyone... I'm so sorry!

00:14:09.944 --> 00:14:12.674
I'm the one who's sorry.

00:14:17.654 --> 00:14:19.784
All right! Let's do this!

00:14:22.554 --> 00:14:28.254
Joan of Arc... Joan of Arc!
Please, come to your senses!

00:14:29.034 --> 00:14:36.304
Why, Joan? You, who once lead an army!
How you've fallen!

00:14:36.804 --> 00:14:38.744
You disappoint us, Joan.

00:14:39.244 --> 00:14:41.364
You were so beautiful once...

00:14:42.244 --> 00:14:44.434
Farewell, Joan of Arc!

00:14:47.814 --> 00:14:49.044
Why?

00:14:50.554 --> 00:14:52.244
Why can't you see her?

00:14:52.584 --> 00:14:55.024
She's right there!

00:14:55.454 --> 00:14:56.654
Mari...

00:14:58.564 --> 00:15:03.294
Oh, Joan! Speak to me, Joan!

00:15:03.694 --> 00:15:09.164
I... I can see you...

00:15:09.934 --> 00:15:11.774
Your form...

00:15:12.544 --> 00:15:14.444
Your smile...

00:15:22.454 --> 00:15:24.314
What's this all about?

00:15:24.454 --> 00:15:27.754
You're sending a megabomber
just to subdue Blue?

00:15:28.224 --> 00:15:29.084
That's right.

00:15:29.254 --> 00:15:32.654
Thanks to you, we have the perfect window.

00:15:32.864 --> 00:15:35.094
Yes, but...

00:15:35.094 --> 00:15:38.724
But that's a tectonic weapon.
There's no need to use that kind of...

00:15:38.904 --> 00:15:39.924
Enough!

00:15:44.474 --> 00:15:45.904
You must be tired.

00:15:46.904 --> 00:15:49.034
Take a vacation.

00:15:52.484 --> 00:15:55.974
Very well, Master Commander.

00:15:57.054 --> 00:15:59.314
Megabomber launch preparations complete!

00:15:59.754 --> 00:16:01.014
Launching!

00:16:07.894 --> 00:16:11.064
When my mom and dad died...

00:16:12.164 --> 00:16:16.724
They found them together, out on a cape.

00:16:17.534 --> 00:16:23.274
They were huddle together,
like they were trying to protect something.

00:16:24.544 --> 00:16:29.714
I guess they were trying to save me...

00:16:34.354 --> 00:16:40.154
Mari... I... I...

00:16:41.064 --> 00:16:44.154
All this time, I've wanted to apologize to you.

00:16:45.504 --> 00:16:47.194
All this time...

00:16:47.464 --> 00:16:51.424
I know an apology doesn't help,
but I'm truly sorry!

00:16:52.474 --> 00:16:57.434
You lost your parents and your memory,
even... all because of me...

00:16:58.514 --> 00:17:01.744
I-I'm so sorry...

00:17:03.384 --> 00:17:07.444
Don't! Don't talk like that!

00:17:11.924 --> 00:17:14.524
Someone who knows the
truth behind the incident?

00:17:16.494 --> 00:17:19.194
I don't want you to apologize to me!

00:17:19.434 --> 00:17:20.704
That's not what I'm trying to say!

00:17:20.704 --> 00:17:21.774
Mari?

00:17:21.774 --> 00:17:22.774
What's with you?

00:17:22.774 --> 00:17:23.134
Practicing the play out here?

00:17:23.134 --> 00:17:26.274
You always think you know everything, and you
try to shoulder everything yourself!
Practicing the play out here?

00:17:26.274 --> 00:17:29.834
You always think you know everything, and you
try to shoulder everything yourself!

00:17:30.114 --> 00:17:32.634
Stupid Hagino!

00:17:33.684 --> 00:17:38.944
Over and over, I wanted to tell you.
But I couldn't.

00:17:39.454 --> 00:17:40.944
Hagino, I...

00:17:48.994 --> 00:17:50.094
What?

00:17:53.364 --> 00:17:55.004
What's that? A UFO?

00:17:55.004 --> 00:17:56.804
It can't be! Must be an airplane!

00:17:56.804 --> 00:17:58.364
It's enormous!

00:18:14.754 --> 00:18:15.914
I've got to go.

00:18:19.394 --> 00:18:20.364
Hagino!

00:18:22.064 --> 00:18:25.154
I'm not done talking to you!

00:18:28.174 --> 00:18:31.234
I'll be back. I promise.

00:18:38.684 --> 00:18:41.114
It's a promise.

00:18:43.254 --> 00:18:45.724
Sugawara speaking. Yes.

00:18:45.924 --> 00:18:49.654
A large-scale aircraft formation,
above Kaio City.

00:18:50.094 --> 00:18:52.424
There, too? I see.

00:18:52.824 --> 00:18:54.764
Yes... Yes.

00:18:55.864 --> 00:18:56.834
Yes...

00:18:57.034 --> 00:18:59.224
Formation approaching Ship 5.

00:18:59.404 --> 00:19:01.134
No response from target!

00:19:04.544 --> 00:19:05.804
They're here.

00:19:05.804 --> 00:19:07.434
One extra heavy-duty bomber.

00:19:07.504 --> 00:19:10.344
And twenty front-line fighters.

00:19:13.044 --> 00:19:14.644
What functioning weapons do we have?

00:19:14.854 --> 00:19:18.474
Right now, only cannon 3!

00:19:18.854 --> 00:19:23.014
We have no choice. Issue a full-blast
attack from cannon 3!

00:19:23.654 --> 00:19:24.884
Full...

00:19:25.194 --> 00:19:26.424
Can you maintain stability?

00:19:26.994 --> 00:19:28.294
I'll do my best!

00:19:28.664 --> 00:19:32.964
Main tank blow. Recovering vessel stability.

00:19:36.874 --> 00:19:39.844
So the rest of us should hold still, right?

00:19:40.074 --> 00:19:40.374
Yes. When the lights come up and Mari says her
line, you should all be as still as possible.

00:19:40.374 --> 00:19:41.474
Teacher!
Yes. When the lights come up and Mari says her
line, you should all be as still as possible.

00:19:41.474 --> 00:19:43.374
How's everything coming?
Yes. When the lights come up and Mari says her
line, you should all be as still as possible.

00:19:43.374 --> 00:19:45.984
Good! Everyone's doing great!
Yes. When the lights come up and Mari says her
line, you should all be as still as possible.

00:19:45.984 --> 00:19:47.814
Yes. When the lights come up and Mari says her
line, you should all be as still as possible.

00:19:48.084 --> 00:19:51.484
All right. Let's run through that part again.

00:19:51.654 --> 00:19:52.914
Okay!

00:19:56.524 --> 00:19:57.584
Joan...

00:19:58.294 --> 00:20:03.994
I think I understand just a little bit
of the sadness and pain you carry.

00:20:11.174 --> 00:20:13.364
Enemy fighters attacking!

00:20:13.444 --> 00:20:14.604
And the megabomber?

00:20:14.974 --> 00:20:17.964
Full blast attack in 50 Biconds!

00:20:19.244 --> 00:20:20.374
Should we fire back?

00:20:20.814 --> 00:20:22.144
There's no time.

00:20:22.454 --> 00:20:25.644
Deploy shield. Fire aerial guns at full power.

00:20:26.284 --> 00:20:28.394
Prepare Canon 3 for targeting.

00:20:28.394 --> 00:20:29.514
Roger.

00:20:37.794 --> 00:20:38.434
Senkoji

00:20:38.434 --> 00:20:42.204
Senkoji
Now, even I can't see you anymore.

00:20:42.904 --> 00:20:45.534
I can no longer hear your voice.

00:20:46.144 --> 00:20:51.204
But Joan, you're still there, aren't you?

00:20:52.344 --> 00:20:54.574
You can hear me, can't you?

00:20:56.114 --> 00:20:57.414
Mari...

00:20:57.654 --> 00:20:59.674
And so, Joan...

00:20:59.854 --> 00:21:02.794
If we meet again...

00:21:05.064 --> 00:21:07.294
If one day, you and I...

00:21:07.994 --> 00:21:09.254
Joan...

00:21:11.764 --> 00:21:13.094
Why?

00:21:13.634 --> 00:21:15.364
Why go this far?

00:21:18.274 --> 00:21:20.864
Heavy duty bomber entering firing range.

00:21:24.744 --> 00:21:26.304
Auto-control is malfunctioning!

00:21:26.514 --> 00:21:30.574
Next time, I'll be truer to my feelings...

00:21:30.954 --> 00:21:33.884
So please come back, Joan...

00:21:34.284 --> 00:21:35.624
Approaching target.

00:21:36.854 --> 00:21:40.764
Severe vessel tilt. Unable to maintain stability.

00:21:44.964 --> 00:21:46.554
Targets dispersing!

00:21:55.174 --> 00:21:58.634
Stability control system down...
the system isn't recovering!

00:21:59.844 --> 00:22:01.944
Vessel tilt increasing.

00:22:02.554 --> 00:22:05.524
Severe vessel tilt. Unable to deploy canons.

00:22:09.454 --> 00:22:10.684
This is...

00:22:12.264 --> 00:22:16.194
System recovering. Correcting tilt.

00:22:28.674 --> 00:22:30.144
Please, Joan...

00:22:30.574 --> 00:22:31.704
Come back...

00:22:41.654 --> 00:22:43.484
I thought it was all over!

00:22:44.764 --> 00:22:48.324
Why did we recover all of a sudden?

00:22:52.064 --> 00:22:55.794
Yes. I wonder...

00:23:05.744 --> 00:23:15.314
Implosion of Blue's Emil Force Drive to produce
a thought-wave freezing byproduct?

00:23:29.004 --> 00:23:36.464
Standing side by side, hand in hand, by the sky

00:23:37.274 --> 00:23:47.324
Pledging our futures to the horizon

00:23:47.324 --> 00:23:54.994
A gentle breeze blowing

00:23:55.694 --> 00:24:03.574
As we melted into tomorrow

00:24:04.174 --> 00:24:07.774
The passing time

00:24:07.774 --> 00:24:13.114
Quietly watches over you

00:24:13.314 --> 00:24:17.054
Our sadness, our good-byes

00:24:17.054 --> 00:24:22.544
And our blue tears all make us stronger

00:24:23.894 --> 00:24:28.194
We sour after our dreams like budding flowers

00:24:28.194 --> 00:24:33.034
Searching for answers in life

00:24:33.034 --> 00:24:37.334
Always believing in the day

00:24:37.334 --> 00:24:43.044
We'll proudly unfurl our petals

00:24:43.044 --> 00:24:47.004
In the blue dreams!

00:25:01.634 --> 00:25:05.394
Hagino returns just in time
for the School Festival.

00:25:06.704 --> 00:25:10.604
She feigns cheer, but Mari is
unable to hide her concern.

00:25:12.144 --> 00:25:15.574
On the eve of the festival, they open
their hearts to each other,

00:25:16.614 --> 00:25:20.274
just as a firestorm adorns the night sky.

00:25:22.614 --> 00:25:27.054
Next time on Blue Drop: Cosmos.
